menu "Ghar Sajag S3 storage lifecycle"

config GS_OUTBOX_BODY_RETIREMENT_ENABLED
    bool "Enable event body retirement requests"
    default n
    help
        Enables the outbox lifecycle retirement code path. Keep disabled until
        the product post-sync retention policy and physical recovery behavior
        are qualified. A separate runtime retention-satisfied authorization,
        backend completion and an authenticated Node retirement report are
        still required for any deletion.

config GS_IDENTITY_COMPACTION_ENABLED
    bool "Enable durable identity compaction and deletion"
    default n
    help
        Keep disabled until replay-fence and identity-generation cutover are
        power-cut qualified on physical S3 LittleFS and retention approval is
        recorded. Host tests do not enable firmware deletion.

endmenu
